	(text "Four relay outputs for standard 12 V coil relays. 2 x AQW212 PhotoMOS (2 Form A): the LED side is LOGIC,\ndriven from MCU pins through 470R (~4.5 mA, operate <= 3 mA); the contact sources +12 V (V12_RLY, fused by F30)\nto OUTn. Coil between OUTn and 0 V (GND_RACK) on the same terminal pair. D40-D43 (1N4148W, 300 mA) catch the coil kick.\nRed LEDs D44-D47 on the rack side show the real output state."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
